# Lessons learned

Landmines hit while building this mod — record them here as you find them, in the same
spirit as PlumbingFixed's `docs/LESSONS-LEARNED.md` and `CLAUDE.md` "Known landmines"
section: what looked true, what was actually true, and how you found out. Future-you (and
Claude) reads this before trusting a vanilla API by its name — see the golden rule in
[CLAUDE.md](../CLAUDE.md).

Suggested shape per entry:

```
## `SomeVanillaMethod()` is not what it sounds like

What it looks like it does: ...
What it actually does (and how you verified it — decompiled source, SP vs MP test): ...
The fix / the guard now in place: ...
```

